# postctl core

Read [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) before changing code (repo map, commands, invariants, pitfalls, checklists). `docs/plan.md` §0 decisions are binding; changing one needs the user.

Top rules:

- **Never** print, log, commit, or put in the ledger/chat/tests/goldens: variable values, tokens, header values, request or response bodies, cookies, or URLs with query strings. Counts, key names and structure only.
- Fixtures are synthetic. `testdata/private/` is gitignored real data; tests using it must skip when absent. Never touch the real Keychain in tests (use `store.MemorySecrets`).
- `internal/engine` never imports TUI or Charm packages. `View` is pure. The store is the only writer of workspace files.
- Mask every output path with `history.Redactor`; extend `internal/qa/secret_leak_test.go` when you add one.
- Gate before done: `task agents:check` (`go build ./...`, `go test -race ./...`, `golangci-lint run`). Do not push. Append to `docs/ledger.md`.
